<div id="u-credit-00440-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/piracyessayist-zero" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6119968); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6119968&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608925503" alt="PiracyEssayist Zero" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6119968)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/piracyessayist-zero" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6119968); return false;">PiracyEssayist Zero</a></span></p>
